---
source: crates/cli/tests/lint.rs
expression: out(&one)
---
sorted-keys
  languages:     json, yaml
  category:      style
  default level: off
  fix:           unsafe

The keys of an object are not in alphabetical order.

Options:
  order (a list of strings, default []): Keys that come first, in this order; the rest follow alphabetically.

Example:
  { "b": 1, "a": 2 }   // becomes { "a": 2, "b": 1 }
